{"version":1,"content":"<p>NASA資助的一項新研究顯示，模擬的銀河系宇宙輻射會在小鼠大腦免疫細胞中引發細微且存在性別差異的分子變化，即使實驗小鼠在測試時並未表現出明顯的記憶或行為障礙。這項研究為理解長期深空任務中輻射對太空人大腦健康的潛在影響提供了新的線索。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587908.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:23:55.422634+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:09:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:17:14.180336+00:00","content_hash":"462454e53e7b76a216d9d18dd7e2272d1da693dd4de47a0f5425fbc61bad2577","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}